WEBVTT

00:48:27.682 --> 00:48:30.234
that there appears to be a frustrating gap

00:48:30.258 --> 00:48:34.280
between humans' natural attention magnets

00:48:34.304 --> 00:48:38.019
and what might be healthy for the culture.

00:48:38.043 --> 00:48:41.736
We've discovered what Rupert Murdoch
has known for a long time,

00:48:41.760 --> 00:48:45.800
that the way to harvest
lots and lots of attention,

00:48:45.824 --> 00:48:47.104
lots of eyeballs,

00:48:47.128 --> 00:48:52.351
is to showcase strong opinion,
anger, outrage, drama.

00:48:52.375 --> 00:48:55.281
Reason does not play, is not a winner.

00:48:55.305 --> 00:48:58.365
DB: Yeah, and I've found I can't Twitter
about sacrificial love.

00:48:58.389 --> 00:48:59.464
(Laughter)

00:48:59.488 --> 00:49:01.288
DB: It doesn't get a lot of retweets.